<title>USA: Hain Food Group Inc Q1 shr shrinks.</title>
<headline>Hain Food Group Inc Q1 shr shrinks.</headline>
<dateline>UNIONDALE, N.Y. 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter Ended</p>
<p>							September 30,</p>
<p>						 1996(a)	     1995</p>
<p> Net sales			     $15,437,000     $13,527,000</p>
<p> Net income				  336,000	   426,000</p>
<p> Net income per share			 0.04		0.05</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>common shares and common share</p>
<p>  equivalents			    8,939,000	 9,045,000</p>
<p>NOTE - (a)  Results for the quarter ended September 30, 1996 include the operations of The Estee Co, which was acquired on November 3, 1995.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
